---
description: Rules for statutory rule editions, employment standards and collective agreements
globs: rules/**,packages/rules/**,packages/modules/time-leave/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` rules 4, 15, 17 and 22, and `docs/08`, `docs/09` and `docs/17` §7 and §11.

- Files under `rules/` are protected data. Never edit a tested edition or a verified agreement version; publish a new one with a source.
- Never hard-code a rate, threshold, notice period, minimum wage or agreement term in code.
- Employment standards entries marked `verify_at_load` cannot be activated in production.
- Overtime, holiday and premium combinations come from `pay_composition`. If a combination is not defined, raise `UNRESOLVED_INTERACTION`. Never choose a default.
- `tests/agreements/stacking_cases.json` is the acceptance suite; `reference/premium_stacking_reference.py` is the specification.
- Changes to `rules/agreements/agreement.schema.json` go in their own pull request for the owner's approval.
